<div class="section height--low align--middle color--default article-hero section-has-background"><div class="section-body"><div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-heading article-title"><h1 class="align-center text-h1">HOTEL PERK a Horský resort Dolní Morava: digitalizace díky Protel</h1></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-dynamic_inline article-date"><div class="align-center">31. 03. 2025</div></div></div></div></div><div class="section-background" style="background-color:rgb(250, 250, 251)"></div></div>
